WEBVTT

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.940
Supplemental lessons?

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.170
Yeah.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:09.680
You took yesterday off sick, didn't you?

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.040
The teacher wants you to do it,

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.290
especially since it's a practical lesson.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:17.440
But cooking practice by myself?

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.520
Be glad.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.080
There are others.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.080
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:32.540
<i>W-Well, I'd be lying if I said this 
lineup doesn't make me glad, but...</i>

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:35.530
Cooking practice again, eh?

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:38.600
So what shall I hunt this time?

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:42.760
I specialize in eating, though.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:44.390
In more ways than one.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.770
I'll get it this time! This time!

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.270
<i>Oh, boy.</i>

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:51.520
<i>I don't see this ending well.</i>

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:26.000
<b>Let's Save the World!</b>

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.040
Let's Save the World!

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:30.640
U-Um, Sensei,

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:33.020
why are Shiragami and all the other—

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.490
You'll be making curry.

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:34.710
Huh? You're ignoring me?

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:37.460
We have all the ingredients ready.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:38.920
The principal decided on a whim

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:42.760
that we teachers will be 
eating the curry you make.

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:44.970
Listen.

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.760
We don't expect much.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.890
Honestly, even if it's terrible, that's fine.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:52.020
So long as it can be called "curry."

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:54.650
S-Sensei?

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:58.650
Kuromine, which is sweeter: salt or sugar?

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:02.100
W-Well, sugar, of course.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.630
Good, Kuromine.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.240
It's all yours now!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.970
W-Wait! What's all mine?

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:08.660
Was I just set up?!

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.160
Shiragami?

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:19.480
What's with her?

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.600
I wish I'd been here for the 
cooking lesson yesterday.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:29.030
It would've been my chance to 
eat a meal made by Shiragami...

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:33.150
Why are you reacting like that?

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.120
Just what happened at the cooking lesson?

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:38.520
I can't do garlic.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:42.230
I'm a vampire.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:45.300
The garlic is making my eyes watery.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.330
What did you do, Shiragami?

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:49.330
Shiragami Youko,

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:50.930
not to worry.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:54.080
I've prepared a recipe this time.

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.760
Seriously, what the heck happened?

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.160
Shiho-san...

00:03:58.910 --> 00:03:59.800
What is it?

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:03.140
You want to eat me more than curry?

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:04.140
All right.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.010
No, no, not that!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.860
I was wondering how good 
Shiragami is at cooking.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.720
Since you're an old friend, 
I thought you'd know...

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.970
She's not bad, I don't think.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:16.540
She makes her own lunches and stuff.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:17.850
I thought so.

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:18.610
But...

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:23.560
Only as long as she doesn't 
panic or try too hard.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.330
All right, let's begin.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:33.020
By the way, you've made curry 
before, right, Class Rep?

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:34.440
Of course.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:38.210
It's brown, rich, and has a very strong scent.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.960
I've seen it in the manga of this planet.

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:42.280
Manga?

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.840
This planet?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:47.160
I used that information to find this recipe.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.930
We have nothing to worry about 
if we follow these directives.

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.230
Yeah!

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:52.980
Phase one!

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:55.230
Chop the ingredients into bite-sized pieces!

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:57.940
Phase two!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:01.690
After chopping, put the so-called roux 
in a bowl and melt it in hot water!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.190
Phase three!

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.180
Cover well-baked batter with

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:09.950
the ingredients you just melted, 
and decorate it with bite-sized fruits!

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.690
And it is done!

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:13.920
Huh?

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.620
A chocolate cake?

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:18.170
Is it curry-flavored?

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.140
Impossible!

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:22.080
This is not curry?

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.760
But the directives are absolute.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:26.090
How could you get those two mixed up?!

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.360
This looks good, though.

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:30.950
What have I done?

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:32.640
What have I done?!

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:46.530
This rich and mellow chocolate aroma!

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:48.290
The smooth texture!

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:53.630
The fine sponge cake and cream 
seem to be dancing a rondo of love.

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:55.200
What is it they call this?

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.250
Yes...

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:59.630
Chocolate cake.

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:02.810
The cake Aizawa-san made is ruined!

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:05.120
Aizawa made it, huh?

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:10.040
Isn't that one of the Seven 
Wonders of the School,

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:12.570
the elusive horned girl?!

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.350
I'm sorry! This is my fault!

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.860
S-Stop it, Class Rep.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:18.950
Y-Yeah.

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:21.060
It's not your fault, Aizawa-san.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.080
But...

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.920
We'll just make it again.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.730
Help us out, okay, Shiho?

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:28.200
Huh? O-Okay...

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.700
You can count on me to figure out how 
many carrots can fit in my cleavage.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.540
Shiho, stop running from reality.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.700
Is she <i>that</i> bad at cooking?

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:38.710
What do we do?

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:39.820
Aizawa-san...

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:43.540
If you quit, this really will be a lost cause.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:45.500
Don't worry.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:48.790
We can handle this if we work together.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.610
Shiragami...

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.950
Yeah, we still have time.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:55.740
We have no bra...

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:58.170
I mean, no plan, though.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.300
Kuromine-kun!

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.520
Oh, my.

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:05.090
We'll just have to do it

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.620
without a recipe!

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.580
<b>Salad oil</b>

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.540
<b>Delicious Milk</b>

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.850
This is looking pretty good, isn't it?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.590
Yeah. I think we'll be okay now.

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.190
Right, Aizawa-san?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.710
I'm humbled by what happened today.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.580
I was too dependent on the plan.

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:56.120
Now I know that one mistake 
will ruin everything.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:58.520
In the same way,

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:00.470
I have let many possibilities,

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:03.500
as well as my unrelenting ambition, go to waste.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.670
Aizawa-san, there's still time.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:15.640
We still haven't put the roux in.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:18.610
Let's do it.

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:21.020
Let's make curry that surpasses our own limits!

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.880
Shiragami Youko...

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:28.170
Yeah.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.480
We don't need a recipe.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:33.650
Let us seek new possibilities together.

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:37.070
Yes. Let us make curry that surpasses curry!

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:42.830
Let us show them our unrelenting ambition!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:46.800
Wait, what the hell are 
they talking about now?

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:49.040
All we have left to do is put the roux in...

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.210
Silence.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.420
There before us is a door of possibilities.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.950
I don't think you should open that door!

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.420
Don't! Shiragami, don't do it!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:08:59.010
Shiragami?!

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:01.100
All right!

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:03.850
Let's surpass curry, Aizawa-san!

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:04.900
Yes!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:08.230
Here.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:10.790
I bought what you asked for.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:11.690
Good job.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.290
My month's allowance...

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:16.740
What is this pudding?

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.840
This had better not be the cheap stuff.

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:20.640
The only acceptable pudding is the

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:24.320
school store's exclusive premium egg 
pudding, of which only ten are available.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:26.400
Oh, well.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:28.560
Perhaps I'll have you massage my shoulders now.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:31.960
And you'll let me interview you after that, right?

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.310
Um...

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.990
I think she's just making you her errand girl.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:36.780
Shut up!

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:38.550
We have a scoop right in front of us.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.470
I can't pass this up.

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:44.120
But still, I don't know about using 
up all your allowance on this.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.880
<i>You</i> do something about it, then.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.370
You're a god of fortune, aren't you?

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:48.460
Akemi?

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:50.480
What are you doing here?

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:53.170
K-Koumoto-sensei...

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:56.190
Kuromine's gang is almost done 
with their supplemental lesson.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.450
I'm not waiting for them.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.490
Then go home already.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.030
She's getting away!

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.200
Stop!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.510
Damn it, stop that! Let go!

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.200
Mooching off students...

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.840
Is that something a principal should do?

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:23.130
I'm teaching the brats a lesson 
about the harshness of reality.

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:26.140
More importantly, can we expect 
good things of the curry?

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.880
The bunch doing the cooking concerns me,

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:30.500
but it's just curry.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.130
Kuromine's there this time, too.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.440
It should be fine.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.840
How's it coming?

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:42.750
I'll take responsibility and eat it all myself.

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:44.300
No! You can't!

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:44.030
I must.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:45.950
If I hadn't said what I did...

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.960
But I'm the one who told you to add <i>that</i>. 
I dealt the finishing blow!

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.820
It was curry until <i>that</i> went into it!

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.960
Let go of me! I must take responsibility!

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:52.960
Why did I...

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:56.110
Well, let's order take-out.

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:56.920
Yeah.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:01.970
<b> What the hell?!                                                                     Gah! Pervert!!</b>

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:12.210
That damned old hag.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:13.860
She really took things too far.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.600
Akari.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:18.820
Why?

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:22.830
Why will you not ask Aizawa?

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:25.110
You reduced the room to dust.

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:27.650
Is that how you ask people for favors?

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:30.250
You don't know.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.030
You don't know the taste 
of Aizawa's chocolate,

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:34.350
or its smoothness!

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:37.250
It was nothing like normal chocolate.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.040
I want to taste it again.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.470
After I've said all this, you still won't ask her?

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.930
If you want that, ask her yourself!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:46.950
I see.

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.640
Then I have no choice.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.890
You're finally giving up?

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.860
I have no choice but to destroy this planet.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:11:59.570
What...

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.940
are you doing?!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.700
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:09.700
And so,

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.960
the fate of the planet 
rests with your chocolate.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.090
What?

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:16.680
I must have misheard.

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:18.360
Earth's fate?

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:19.450
Sorry.

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:22.970
I understood up to the point where 
you asked me to make chocolate.

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:27.500
The principal can't forget the taste 
of the chocolate she had the other day.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.140
Now she's talking about destroying the world.

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:33.960
N-Nah, she wouldn't do that.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.260
Even if she's a devil.

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:38.480
Y-Yeah. Don't joke about
that, Koumoto-sensei.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:39.520
Wh-What?

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.610
What's going on?

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:42.820
What's this about a devil?

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.690
An emergency communication 
from the homeworld?

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:54.400
Akane-chan, you could just ask us 
to make tasty chocolate for you.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.630
You don't have to tell such a huge lie.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.050
Let's hurry, Shiragami Youko.

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.900
We have three hours and twenty-four minutes.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:07.550
The future of Earth has been 
entrusted to our chocolate.

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:09.120
You believe her?

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:12.020
Aizawa-san, where'd you come 
up with such a specific time?

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.460
From this.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:18.560
Mysterious object approaching Earth

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:18.560
We've just received word that a huge, 
mysterious object is approaching Earth.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:21.440
The object is believed 
to be a massive asteroid,

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:24.820
and it is approaching Earth
at an unbelievable speed.

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.960
Oh, no! Is this for real?

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:29.640
No way! I haven't even had my first kiss!

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:31.200
S-Say what?

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:34.700
An asteroid is heading toward Earth?

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.320
This is Houston. This is Houston.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:40.460
Give me a status report.

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:43.770
Chief, we lost contact.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.440
We need a plan, now!

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.300
Call the White House.

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:51.010
We won't be sleeping tonight, boys.

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:54.580
But why did you bring me here?

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.640
I can't cook at all.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.960
I-It's okay! If we work together...

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.690
Stay out of this, you klutz.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.440
I'm not a klutz!

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:04.900
<i>Silly Akari.</i>

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.250
<i>If you'd done this from the start,</i>

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.700
<i>I wouldn't have had to end 
this planet with an asteroid.</i>

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:13.740
<i>But this should be fun.</i>

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:19.030
<i>Depending on her chocolate, 
I might reconsider the asteroid impact.</i>

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:25.760
Okay.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:29.800
News: Asteroid expected to miss Earth

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:29.800
I've just been told that the asteroid's 
trajectory has suddenly changed.

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:32.550
<i>Shoot!</i>

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:36.350
<i>Even I can't lose focus when 
I'm controlling an asteroid.</i>

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:42.760
<i>Well, I can't blame myself for
letting my guard down a little.</i>

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.070
Aizawa-san, you're done already?

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:49.950
Wait, when did you cool those chocolates?

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:52.610
<i>Those truffles!</i>

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:54.950
<i>I can tell even from this distance!</i>

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:59.330
<i>The tender crispness concealing 
the softness within!</i>

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.080
<i>I want to play with it!</i>

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.460
<i>Give it to me! Give it to me right now!</i>

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:07.380
No.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.260
This isn't good enough!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:16.720
<i>Damn!</i>

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.850
<i>I almost lost control.</i>

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.360
It seems there's been another change 
in the asteroid's movement.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.390
Aizawa-san?

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:26.640
What are you doing?

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:28.830
Earth's future is on the line.

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:32.160
This chocolate can't save the world.

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:35.030
<i>It's Aizawa's chocolate!</i>

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:37.880
Wh-What are you saying?
It's more than enough, Aizawa.

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.830
I approve!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.090
Now, now, Principal.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:44.740
Let's let her have her way a bit longer.

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:47.340
You heard what Aizawa said.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.010
A-Akari...

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.550
No, I think if I eat that, 
the asteroid will stop.

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:55.150
That may be.

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:56.550
But...

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:59.430
I bet it'll stop if you pass out, too.

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:02.940
Hey! Why have you tied me up?!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.800
I just noticed a moment ago.

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:07.400
Even you seem to let your guard down

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.900
when you're controlling an asteroid.

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:13.970
Now,

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:17.620
we have about three hours 
until the asteroid hits.

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:21.010
I hope you can endure it, you old hag.

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:25.210
Three hours of creative chocolates 
made by everyone <i>except</i> Aizawa.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:27.290
<i>I've been set up!</i>

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:30.110
<i>I get it. Aizawa was a decoy!</i>

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:33.000
<i>Akari was counting on the 
others doing it all this time!</i>

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:35.300
<i>Is she doing this to get revenge on me?</i>

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.430
I-Is this about your apartment?

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.120
Or...

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:41.680
Is it about my bowling with your 
precious Japanese rice wine?

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:45.040
<b>Congratulations
Akari-sensei</b>

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:46.900
Or is it because I left a huge message 
on the schoolgrounds on your birthday?

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.900
<b>years old</b>

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:51.650
<b>Akari</b>

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:51.650
Or is it because I swapped out your marriage 
arrangement photos with your old photos?

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:56.110
You did all that, did you, Principal?

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.920
C-Crap!

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:58.950
I'm finished.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:03.620
I've never made chocolate before, Principal.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:06.250
I don't know if it's any good.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.080
Here, a chocolate banana.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.750
<b>Chocolate Tramp-ana</b>

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:10.750
Rather, chocolate tramp-ana.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.800
<i>Wh-What is this stench of rotting...</i>

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:18.260
<i>No, thoroughly rotten fruit?</i>

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:19.780
Here, Principal.

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:21.680
Accept it gratefully.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.600
N-No, don't—

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:28.350
<i>The odor filling my mouth,</i>

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:31.510
<i>and the sweet-and-sour aftertaste...</i>

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:33.440
<i>No, it's just sour.</i>

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.320
<i>How can I describe it?</i>

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:37.910
<i>Yup, it's spoiled.</i>

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.400
H-How is it?

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:44.790
<i>Why didn't you use that obviously fresh 
banana that's between your boobs?</i>

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.870
But I survived.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.220
I won't let Akari have her way!

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:50.190
Akane-chan.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:56.130
Knowing you, I'm sure you've 
had all kinds of chocolate,

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.550
but I bet you've never had 
anything like this before.

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:01.930
Chocolate?

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:04.560
No, this doesn't smell like chocolate.

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:08.560
But what is this familiar spicy smell?

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:13.550
I added some curry spices 
to give it a deeper flavor.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:14.970
I used...

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:18.840
cumin, turmeric, peppers, tabasco,

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:21.350
allspice, momiji manju, carda—

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:22.950
That's practically curry!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.690
Now, now, Principal.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:28.810
Shiragami worked hard to make this chocolate.

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:30.580
W-Wait!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:34.300
There's no way it tastes anything 
like curry after that klutz made it!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.530
Shut up!

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:37.550
Earth's fate is on the line!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:38.340
Take it!

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.390
<i>E-Endure it!</i>

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.010
<i>Endure it, me!</i>

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:44.800
<i>Look, Aizawa's working fast.</i>

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:48.060
<i>Her second chocolate is almost done already.</i>

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:53.520
<i>The other two don't have the skill to 
finish theirs before the asteroid hits.</i>

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:56.540
<i>Which means, if I can just get through this...</i>

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:57.940
Hey!

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.320
What are you doing at a time like this?

00:19:01.270 --> 00:19:02.670
Akemi Mikan?

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.260
What's this?

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:06.560
You're making food for this horned girl?

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:07.780
Yes, that's right.

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:10.250
Would you mind helping us?

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:13.640
Of course I will.

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:16.590
I have a bit of a bone to 
pick with this horned girl,

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:19.220
but given the circumstances, I'll forgive her.

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:22.300
I'll give it all I've got.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.210
A-Akari, let's talk this over.

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:27.210
I-I'll give you half of the world!

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:28.130
How's that?

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:30.420
What's wrong?

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:32.560
You sound like some two-bit baddie.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:34.580
Shut up, spinster!

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:37.360
No chance of reconciliation, eh?

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:40.280
<b>Asteroid impact in</b>

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:40.280
We have two hours and forty minutes left.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.570
Let's play chicken!

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:44.200
Will the asteroid hit first,

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.990
or will you drop dead first?

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:48.280
Fool!

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:51.370
You just lost your last chance to save Earth!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.880
You'll have time to regret it in Hell!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.530
You lose

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:17.170
Dummy

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:29.290
Chief, the asteroid!

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:31.850
The asteroid's flying away from Earth!

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:33.940
Damn it all!

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:36.280
Is this a dream or something?!

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:38.440
A dream? No, it's a miracle.

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:39.400
Yes...

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:41.030
Shiragami!

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:44.870
Earth has been saved.

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:48.540
Wh-What the heck happened here?

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:24.750
<b>Shimada and Shiho's Slightly Erotic Quiz</b>

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:24.750
Shimada and Shiho's Slightly Erotic Quiz!

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:45.060
<b>Is a bullet train...</b>

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:45.060
<b>Male?                                                        Female?</b>

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:25.700
Question!

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:28.390
Is a bullet train male or female?

00:23:28.390 --> 00:23:30.370
I think I know where this is going.

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:33.640
If Kuromine-kun isn't going to answer, I will.

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:35.080
No, I'll answer.

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:36.090
I should do this.

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:37.140
No, I will.

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:38.440
O-Okay, then I'll...

00:23:38.440 --> 00:23:39.440
By all means.

00:23:39.440 --> 00:23:40.910
You really went there?!

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:42.660
Um, the answer is...

00:23:42.660 --> 00:23:44.450
"male," right?

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:45.060
Why male?

00:23:45.060 --> 00:23:46.190
Why?

00:23:45.060 --> 00:23:47.860
<b>Next Episode:
"Let's Put On Our Swimsuits!"</b>

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:48.290
Because a man and a train both 
slide in and out of the sta—

00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:50.900
We can't say the answer on the air!
